--- TS5_generation (SMD_inter_beta) ---

Generates rep1's starting TS5-region configuration ('TS5_rep1.lmp') via an initial SMD run
along 'dD', before the ../TS5_TS2/ leg pulls from it -- same pattern as ../TS1_generation/.
Holds only input/log files (no restart/lmp_files output visible yet), consistent with
TS5_TS2/ itself not having produced output as of this review.

Note: this README documents pre-existing content; no existing file was modified.
